[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 567.509, "timestamp": "00:09:27", "text": "好吧，我們還沒錯過日落，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 570.07, "timestamp": "00:09:30", "text": "所以別擔心。我要帶你去看看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 572.87, "timestamp": "00:09:32", "text": "日落。我們就是為此而來"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 576.15, "timestamp": "00:09:36", "text": "。雖然我有點遲到了，但我還是會聯絡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 593.59, "timestamp": "00:09:53", "text": "我的老師或其他什麼人。"}]